{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的 S09 把“难受时想有人陪”改成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，把原本开放的动机疑问推向了更强烈的自我牺牲解释，细微地改变了人物心理。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的重点短语加亮，让普通观众扫过时能迅速抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化；感受文字小字呈现并随音乐到时出现，也减少了同时处理大量信息的负担。它不仅交代了离开、怀念、动摇、重新站稳的故事，还用身体感受、音乐质地和情绪转折把这些阶段连接起来，尤其对怀念中的温暖、刺痛、疲惫和短暂安定有更细腻的区分。Y 的叙事同样完整，但右侧感受词容易形成需要集中阅读的一大堆信息，X 更容易让观众边听边理解。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "627be94b-2c0d-4354-b407-61ecaeb2d440", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T001956182163Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:20:39.337704+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b93a798149d593b796cdc1bf972631b4d97d3fd6425fbec6706e410783d20b87", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3f